! Catalogue of positions of compact radio sources
! ===============================================
!
! Catalogue name:             rfc_2024a
! Number of objects:          21908
! Home page of the catalogue: http://astrogeo.org/vlbi/solutions/rfc_2024a
! Catalogue generated by      Leonid Petrov
! File generated on           2024.04.12-07:24:39
!
! This catalogue contains positions and estimates of flux density of
! 21,907 compact radio sources from reanalysis of 1086 VLBI experiments under
! 67 absolute astrometry and geodesy programs at the VLBA, LBA, EVN, CVN,
! and IVS in 1994-2023, as well as other VLBI experiments under geodesy and
! absolute astrometry since 1980.04.11 through 2024.03.11, in total 19,228
! experiments. 25 million values of group delays were used in the solution.
!
!
